### 2. `css/style.css`
Design system haut de gamme, typographies luxueuses, structure fluide, animations CSS et accessibilité (`prefers-reduced-motion`).

```css
/* DESIGN SYSTEM & VARIABLES */
:root {
    --bg-primary: #0a0a0a;
    --bg-secondary: #121212;
    --bg-tertiary: #1a1a1a;
    --gold: #d4af37;
    --gold-light: #f3e5ab;
    --gold-dark: #aa8c2c;
    --text-main: #f5f5f7;
    --text-muted: #9a9a9f;
    --border-color: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
    --transition-smooth: all 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    --font-heading: 'Cinzel', serif;
    --font-sans: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
}

/* RESET & BASE */
*, *::before, *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    font-size: 16px;
}

body {
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    overflow-x: hidden;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

/* TYPOGRAPHY */
h1, h2, h3, h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--gold-light);
}

.subtitle {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

/* NAVIGATION */
.site-header {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    z-index: 1000;
    background: rgba(10, 10, 10, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

.nav-container {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
}

.logo {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
}

.logo span {
    color: var(--gold);
}

.nav-links {
    display: flex;
    list-style: none;
    gap: 3rem;
}

.nav-links a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
}

.nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--gold);
}

.cart-btn {
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    color: var(--text-main);
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
}

.cart-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--gold);
    color: var(--gold);
}

.cart-count {
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
}

/* BOUTONS GÉNÉRAUX */
.btn-primary, .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    border-radius: 2px;
}

.btn-primary {
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
    font-weight: 600;
}

.btn-primary:hover {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--gold-light);
}

.btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--text-main);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
}

.btn-secondary:hover {
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--bg-primary);
    border-color: var(--gold);
}

/* HERO CINÉMATIQUE */
.hero-cinematic {
    height: 100vh;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
    position: relative;
}

.hero-content h1 {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
